[{"title":"墨笔牡丹 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"京路缁尘欲满丛，娇羞无语立东风。\n夜深聊向灯前看，颜色虽殊骨格同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9168,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨笔牡丹 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"一朵萧然带墨痕，玉阑干畔倚黄昏。\n也知不作金棱碧，何用韩郎为染根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9169,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白马","author":"倪岳","text":"春草芊绵柳拂堤，玉骢翘立不闻嘶。\n祗缘一入神龙厩，閒却沙场万里蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9170,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题夏太常竹","author":"倪岳","text":"冉冉云烟堕墨池，隔窗疏影弄参差。\n清卿老去风流在，得见当年第一枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9171,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时猫四首 其一","author":"倪岳","text":"玉雪娟娟好羽衣，小山花竹正晴晖。\n翻盆倒瓮无心问，閒看东风蛱蝶飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9172,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时猫四首 其二","author":"倪岳","text":"养得狸奴解策勋，可怜小雀已离群。\n生平威力才如此，莫遣君家鼠辈闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9173,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时猫四首 其三","author":"倪岳","text":"步出花阴野雀高，惊心短翼免相遭。\n主人莫更穿鱼待，田叟迎猫已自劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9174,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"四时猫四首 其四","author":"倪岳","text":"狰猛狸奴乳虎同，菊边高卧饱霜风。\n养威好作他时用，一举须令鼠穴空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9175,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望海潮 题水仙扇面","author":"倪岳","text":"冰玉为肌，沉檀为骨，天然素体倾城。\n鼓瑟湘潭，捐珰澧浦，凌波微度飞琼。\n何处是蓬瀛。\n正忍寒送目，借水成名。\n东阁官梅，两般标格一般清。\n娇黄腻粉轻盈。\n有心安冷淡，节抱幽贞。\n压倒酴醾，搀先桃李，花时争遣交并。\n临镜渐分明。\n但半奁掩面，千里关情。\n山谷山矾出门，一笑大江横。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9176,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"吟断难成调，尘编重绎寻。\n兴亡今古事，精一圣贤心。\n新月何时满，寒蛩无数吟。\n夜深双过鸟，犹自恋高林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9177,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"人岁恒难百，光阴苦易过。\n身心须点检，事业莫蹉跎。\n豪俊今宁少，庸凡古亦多。\n要知贤不肖，择术在如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9178,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自警","author":"吴与弼","text":"读书悟至言，反躬屡紬绎。\n颇谓无他岐，立可超凡域。\n云胡心自戕，作事潜乖昔。\n俯仰一长叹，惭惶竟何极。\n乃知真切功，不可弛顷刻。\n发愤矢自兹，群邪当远迹。\n圣途虽渺茫，敢吝驽骀力。\n诚当通鬼神，志当贯金石。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9179,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"族叔父仲学先生春月承访弼时赁房方定兹别数月矣有怀寄诗","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆昨烟花暖正繁，远劳玉趾到山间。\n寓居踪迹应方定，入道工夫总未閒。\n囊里有书供月眼，樽前无酒醉春颜。\n别来新趣知多少，透彻灵台第几关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9180,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"腊月望日作","author":"吴与弼","text":"欲到大贤地，须循下学工。\n文章深讲贯，道德细磨砻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9181,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春夜","author":"吴与弼","text":"十年踪迹寓神州，故国归来更百忧。\n事业有期空仰古，浮沉无计却随流。\n谁怜白日难停驭，自觉秋霜易到头。\n多少慇勤孤负也，欲从何处觅同游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9182,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿白梅洲","author":"吴与弼","text":"道傍茅屋是谁家，薄暮东来一税车。\n败壁不堪题姓字，时从篱槿看秋花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9183,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柏","author":"吴与弼","text":"润色还因带雨荣，柔枝未许拂云横。\n风霜莫厌多经历，自古良材老始成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9184,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过南康","author":"吴与弼","text":"迢递见危楼，家家枕碧流。\n山高云气近，江阔浪声浮。\n事业怀先哲，英雄慨昔游。\n几多今古兴，斜日满芳洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9185,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梁训导","author":"吴与弼","text":"未到都昌县，相思先计程。\n连绵官舍饮，浩荡故乡情。\n柳色雨来长，梅香霁后清。\n极知期待远，别语细叮咛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9186,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻笳","author":"吴与弼","text":"扁舟晴泊枉渚沙，苇苗满目稀人家。\n夜江漠漠星横斜，东风吹鬓怜春华。\n隔江谁舫寂无哗，数声悲响空中笳。\n响彻碧霄哀更加，悠悠绿水天一涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9187,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元日","author":"吴与弼","text":"淑气已回春，晴光遍八垠。\n学须年共长，德必日俱新。\n自得颜渊乐，宁论原宪贫。\n两间期不愧，敢负百年身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9188,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别王上舍","author":"吴与弼","text":"旅馆相逢日，春风二月初。\n看花杯共把，对月榻同铺。\n礼乐沾清化，风云快壮图。\n愿公多令誉，纲纪在人扶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9189,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与友人夜话","author":"吴与弼","text":"话尽情难极，中宵眠更兴。\n古人俱已逝，后进竟何成。\n世路应皆醉，吾侪岂独醒。\n几回静想遍，无以答平生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9190,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦洗马先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"先生天下士，遇我独情亲。\n剪烛论心夜，焚香读易晨。\n已私须尽克，天理必全纯。\n惆恨春宵梦，分明笑语温。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9191,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双燕春日营巢","author":"吴与弼","text":"忆昨初开桃李花，衔泥飞傍小窗斜。\n春风一去无消息，何处归来更作家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9192,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中歌次王右丞韵","author":"吴与弼","text":"地寥夐兮山深，聊栖迟兮林木。\n欲寡过兮身轻，日往来兮幽谷。\n行愧今兮交疏，心悲古兮趣独。\n理桔槔兮灌园，更搴萝兮补屋。\n晨光澹兮观鱼，夕阳收兮饮犊。\n居从静兮积尘，岁愿丰兮登谷。\n戒迂学兮徇名，嫌荒志兮干禄。\n惟造道兮是期，何富贵兮可卜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9193,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行","author":"吴与弼","text":"野水荒村僻，云林细路斜。\n晴松张翠盖，秋果熟丹砂。\n怅望淹乡曲，蹉跎改岁华。\n西风吹薄袂，兴绪绕天涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9194,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访胡徵君馆所","author":"吴与弼","text":"行客林边至，高人篱外迎。\n远乘今日兴，细话旧时情。\n凉夜一樽酒，清秋半壁灯。\n相看惊老大，踪迹共浮萍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9195,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中漫述","author":"吴与弼","text":"违侍亲庭远，迁居此地新。\n往来多故旧，问劳总比邻。\n屋破长防雨，天寒早闭门。\n卑栖聊自慰，图史共朝昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9196,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松下","author":"吴与弼","text":"倦来更向山中憩，满径松阴白昼长。\n藉地不知孤坐久，遗编又诵两三行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9197,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感兴","author":"吴与弼","text":"月到芭蕉影半斜，好天良夜兴无涯。\n金风声满千竿竹，玉露光生一砌花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9198,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"写怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"悠悠万古愁，瞑坐无一语。\n志须自强持，仁拟谁相辅。\n萧然环堵间，沉吟寸心苦。\n荒村秋思多，断续芭蕉雨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9199,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登拟岘台","author":"吴与弼","text":"城据东南胜，台分襄楚名。\n人烟萦近市，竹树杂长汀。\n愁逐登临散，神因眺望清。\n穷通看万物，未易达浮生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9200,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠戴锦舟先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"尊酒黄城夜，交期是偶然。\n文章元共赏，谈笑剧忘年。\n近腊梅初放，凌寒菊正鲜。\n同衾坐无寐，高兴两绵绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9201,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其一","author":"吴与弼","text":"草树风暄翠欲浮，洞门深处野花幽。\n素琴不许闲人听，山自巍巍水自流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9202,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其二","author":"吴与弼","text":"瀑洗层崖净世尘，阴阴苔径足南薰。\n日长谁是山中伴，袖手前溪立白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9203,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其三","author":"吴与弼","text":"西风红叶绕苔矶，水冷烟寒雁正飞。\n浮虑尽消身寂寞，得鱼无意起竿迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9204,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四景画 其四","author":"吴与弼","text":"村雪寒凝夜色浮，清江如玉着扁舟。\n风流自得天然妙，心迹何曾泥去留。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9205,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"墨梅寄同安李宜之","author":"吴与弼","text":"学疏才薄谅何为，牢落尘踪阅岁时。\n秪有梅花共心事，便风吹向故人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9206,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓","author":"吴与弼","text":"晓梦初惊觉，春禽已乱鸣。\n北风半夜雨，东旭一窗晴。\n道在心偏逸，诗成气转清。\n行藏信随遇，庶以达吾生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9207,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题歙云诗卷","author":"吴与弼","text":"歙云南望迥，亲舍孝思深。\n川陆几年客，晨昏千里心。\n春风随使节，夜月照行襟。\n养志古来重，功名好自任。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9208,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送饶提举之官广东","author":"吴与弼","text":"奉节承深宠，之官过旧乡。\n亲闱春广大，宦路日舒长。\n岭树连云合，江流过雨凉。\n倚门应有望，雁信好频将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9209,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读罢","author":"吴与弼","text":"隐几初收卷，巡檐更出行。\n晚云随雨散，霁月近人明。\n客久无违性，身閒独称情。\n荣枯何足问，清白是家声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9210,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡觉","author":"吴与弼","text":"午枕睡熟馀，情神喜宣朗。\n窗含白日静，座纳微风爽。\n俯披圣贤书，遗言如指掌。\n至理谅易求，良心贵有养。\n安得同志人，辅我加勉强。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9211,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送严府判考满","author":"吴与弼","text":"柳绿绕江头，薰风快壮游。\n万山辞楚徼，一水接皇州。\n郡剧民俱化，铨明课最优。\n垂衣图至治，清问有嘉猷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9212,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简戴锦舟先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"笔砚长为伍，思深趣转清。\n看云閒隐几，听雨独挑灯。\n俯仰求无愧，穷通不系情。\n客边微恙在，襟抱贵和平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9213,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"水自幽偏山自深，竹窗花牖昼沉沉。\n逢人若问浮生事，半是閒眠半是吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9214,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓出","author":"吴与弼","text":"际晓出柴扉，清凉过雨时。\n落花香满径，芳树绿成帷。\n鸟哢有馀暇，水流无尽期。\n值予道心长，归咏正相宜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9215,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游广寿寺后园","author":"吴与弼","text":"新竹多垂箨，高花正满林。\n云萝穿屈曲，苔径入幽深。\n翠积丛茅暗，青交杂树阴。\n剧便新结构，端称读书心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9216,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦友","author":"吴与弼","text":"园林到何日，羁旅念离群。\n扰扰一旬内，依依两梦君。\n秋风黄叶下，晴色白云屯。\n应有诗三百，心期欲细论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9217,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬陈进士","author":"吴与弼","text":"独凭吟几坐清朝，閒看行云面碧霄。\n忽忆故人秋寺里，西风琪树雨潇潇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9218,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"彝公房","author":"吴与弼","text":"入院先看竹，逢僧不说经。\n白云方丈室，清昼一孤灯。\n积雨匀秋色，残阳报晚晴。\n去留无定迹，香尽拂衣行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9219,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄湖西族叔父仲学先生","author":"吴与弼","text":"茅屋石桥西，相亲记旧时。\n青灯近人早，明月上窗迟。\n物理推今古，人情较是非。\n笑谈如昨日，寒暑几推移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9220,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠别友人","author":"吴与弼","text":"惆怅一年别，慇勤百里来。\n冰霜苦节在，宇宙壮怀开。\n白雪传新卷，青春递客杯。\n纷纷枫叶下，独伴野人回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9221,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阅九韶吟稿","author":"吴与弼","text":"高枕微吟罢，西斋独坐时。\n閒澄病中思，细看别来诗。\n点窜非吾事，渐磨贵自期。\n灵台宜有养，孟子浩然师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9222,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别湖西","author":"吴与弼","text":"送送长村外，新诗咏不休。\n浮云日色薄，随地露华稠。\n曲径缘林转，深沟带叶流。\n家山应暂住，更得话绸缪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9223,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同锁秀才道中即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"桑梓常留念，蹉蛇今始还。\n行行减客路，望望近家山。\n胶漆故人谊，风霜游子颜。\n何能谢尘鞅，高卧白云閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9224,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题庸轩","author":"吴与弼","text":"物理本平常，人心自渺茫。\n细袪今古惑，多漱圣贤芳。\n风月清江曲，园林古县傍。\n悠悠百年兴，良与此轩长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9225,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禅岭即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"傍险跻攀倦，临高眺望赊。\n天连苍野阔，树带小村斜。\n晴霭山何处，寒烟屋数家。\n踌躇怀往事，容易改年华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9226,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与钟生同宿东陂","author":"吴与弼","text":"日落辞莲塘，东陂到已暝。\n烟雾村径微，灯花茅斋静。\n细语夜卧迟，月华发清兴。\n黄卷试一开，琅然共歌咏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9227,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜访九韶","author":"吴与弼","text":"有客夜扣门，微吟带星立。\n主人久青灯，欣然肃而入。\n胜境失追攀，高堂更欢集。\n丈夫襟抱开，尘绊嗟何及。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9228,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠九韶","author":"吴与弼","text":"我与生契家，恳恳常告戒。\n退而省其私，立志能匪懈。\n相逢索居后，新知颇超迈。\n深培仁义根，势利无芥蒂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9229,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居","author":"吴与弼","text":"偶坐柴门下，得与众山友。\n雨后已芳润，云开更奇秀。\n澹然忘我形，不觉沉吟久。\n却忆平昔居，于兹几翘首。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9230,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别九韶叔侄","author":"吴与弼","text":"我心日悠悠，喜与故人遇。\n相随更过村，同游读书处。\n研墨倩儿童，颇得临池趣。\n青山一分手，山留白云去。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9231,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"身外机事閒，心地何优游。\n晴行山水曲，步迟境弥幽。\n历乱高鸟过，散漫轻烟浮。\n遗编幸在手，微意仍相侔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9232,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游南坑冈","author":"吴与弼","text":"松边涉幽径，天青雨新霁。\n矫首立崇冈，叠嶂罗迢递。\n尘虑都淡然，二仪足清气。\n妙趣匪言传，飘飘离人世。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9233,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"吴与弼","text":"青灯夜已分，遗编味方永。\n一唱而三叹，转觉寸心烱。\n丽水金最精，蓝田玉偏瑩。\n云胡苦茅塞，久未臻斯境。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9234,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事","author":"吴与弼","text":"风威遍野号，雪花满空坠。\n谁谓惜苦寒，正喜兆丰岁。\n红炉坐终日，黄卷静相对。\n至哉圣贤言，妙契心自醉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9235,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"吴与弼","text":"孤灯读已倦，就床聊偃仰。\n平生所践履，历历时在想。\n中道立苦难，学问少勉强。\n古人岂易期，中宵独惝恍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9236,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读孟子","author":"吴与弼","text":"夜气向虚朗，剪烛更已深。\n大哉仁义言，沃我萌蘖心。\n才质各高下，性命无古今。\n圣贤恳垂训，而我何陆沉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9237,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"睡起","author":"吴与弼","text":"久客逢寒食，芳年损病心。\n几时鸣雨歇，终日落花深。\n亲梦凝官舍，乡魂绕故林。\n昼长春睡起，寂寂写孤吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9238,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"閒述","author":"吴与弼","text":"静里生诗思，閒中长道心。\n自应尊椟玉，不省说籯金。\n芳树流春色，空庭落午阴。\n日和风更澹，此乐有谁寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":9239,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]